        "id": 1003095
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-01T06:22:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The creator_type dimension is needed for the 5th test case covered in this template, which requires the test user to be created by an LDAP admin — this verifies that a service user can change the password of a user originally created via LDAP.\n\nSince Local_Admin and Service_User resolve to the same credentials (${OPENBMC_USERNAME} / ${OPENBMC_PASSWORD}),it has now been consolidated into a single IF branch with a comment clarifying this. The LDAP_Admin creator branch remains separate as it uses different credentials and tests a distinct scenario.",
